WEBVTT

00:07.785 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.225 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:43.625 --> 01:45.025
Stay. Sit.

01:53.905 --> 01:54.945
Your silly master is calling.

01:58.625 --> 02:00.025
-Hello?
-Hello.

02:00.545 --> 02:02.025
Tracy said…

02:02.105 --> 02:02.985
What's wrong with your voice?

02:04.025 --> 02:05.265
Getting all emotional?

02:06.985 --> 02:07.825
No.

02:08.665 --> 02:10.385
I'm calling to thank you.

02:11.945 --> 02:13.025
It was nothing.

02:14.345 --> 02:15.265
How are you going to thank me?

02:17.505 --> 02:19.145
I'll buy you dinner.

02:19.985 --> 02:21.105
When?

02:21.865 --> 02:22.785
Tomorrow.

02:24.745 --> 02:25.985
What are you up to today?

02:26.625 --> 02:30.625
I promised to help Sun Yu
with her first startup event.

02:33.465 --> 02:34.425
Alright.

02:53.705 --> 02:57.665
BUCKET LIST

03:05.785 --> 03:08.145
MY HEART WAITS ONLY FOR YOU

03:13.025 --> 03:14.185
Please sign here.

03:18.025 --> 03:19.705
Drink this. I'm good.

03:20.305 --> 03:22.545
It's a relief having you here.
I'm swamped inside.

03:22.625 --> 03:24.345
Don't worry. I've got
things covered out here.

03:25.265 --> 03:26.225
I'll leave this to you.

03:26.305 --> 03:28.025
-Go on.
-I'm going.

03:28.785 --> 03:29.705
Sign here.

03:30.545 --> 03:31.705
-This way.
-Sign here, right?

03:31.785 --> 03:33.585
Yeah. Here. This way.

03:33.665 --> 03:34.505
Number 13.

03:34.585 --> 03:35.585
Hello, miss.

03:35.665 --> 03:36.945
Mind if I get to know you?

03:37.025 --> 03:39.545
There are lots of great members inside.

03:39.625 --> 03:41.505
You can go in and meet people.

03:42.505 --> 03:43.945
What's your number?

03:44.025 --> 03:45.145
May I get to know you?

03:46.945 --> 03:47.985
You can head in first.

03:48.065 --> 03:49.745
There'll be plenty of people
to welcome you.

03:50.265 --> 03:52.545
-Alright.
-Please fill in detals, Sir.

03:52.625 --> 03:53.865
‎Thank you.

03:55.985 --> 03:57.065
This way, please.

03:57.625 --> 03:58.465
‎Thank you.

04:00.145 --> 04:01.105
-Keep an eye on things for me.
-Okay.

04:01.185 --> 04:02.865
-Give me one of those.
-Alright.

04:10.745 --> 04:12.025
Are you here for the matchmaking?

04:12.625 --> 04:15.105
You put on makeup and dressed up nicely.

04:18.305 --> 04:19.745
What are you doing here?

04:20.905 --> 04:22.705
I came to check out the investment project
I recommended,

04:23.225 --> 04:24.705
only to find out it was a dating scam.

04:26.065 --> 04:28.545
Don't put it that way.
It's not a dating scam.

04:29.785 --> 04:33.305
Sun Yu is organizing
a normal singles networking event.

04:34.545 --> 04:35.625
Tao Zhi Yao Yao.

04:37.265 --> 04:39.625
Graduated from Penn.
Works for a foreign company.

04:39.705 --> 04:40.545
Four hundred thousand a year.

04:41.265 --> 04:43.305
171 centimeters tall. 54 kilograms.

04:43.385 --> 04:46.145
Enjoys skiing, diving, and golf.

04:46.945 --> 04:48.465
Fluent in three languages.

04:49.065 --> 04:51.425
Luan Nian, the profile
was computer-generated.

04:51.505 --> 04:53.705
You know that.
I can't do any of those sports.

04:55.225 --> 04:57.625
This account has chatted with 45 members.

04:59.105 --> 05:00.505
So when you said
you were busy during weekends,

05:02.145 --> 05:04.945
you were actually here
pretending to date people?

05:08.705 --> 05:10.505
Those accounts are all managed
by the company.

05:10.585 --> 05:12.345
I've never logged into it.

05:12.425 --> 05:14.065
Then that proves this app is a scam.

05:14.905 --> 05:15.865
I'm stopping the investment.

05:16.465 --> 05:18.945
I'll notify the investors
and reassess these risks.

05:19.025 --> 05:20.065
Don't.

05:20.145 --> 05:21.945
Don't drag Sun Yu into this because of me.

05:22.025 --> 05:24.665
She's still in the startup stage.
It hasn't been easy for her.

05:24.745 --> 05:26.385
Don't stop the investment.

05:27.505 --> 05:28.705
Then get another investor,

05:29.385 --> 05:30.585
so she can get money sooner

05:30.665 --> 05:34.545
and hire more actors
for these dating scam events.

05:45.105 --> 05:46.105
Don't take me for a fool.

06:11.585 --> 06:13.265
ARE YOU SURE YOU WANT
TO DELETE YOUR ACCOUNT?

06:13.345 --> 06:14.185
DELETE ACCOUNT

06:29.025 --> 06:31.665
Very well. Dating scams are cheap.

06:31.745 --> 06:34.625
Even if you're just a shill,
it's nothing to be proud of.

06:57.505 --> 07:00.105
-My back is killing me.
-Come here, Luke.

07:00.185 --> 07:01.825
I'm exhausted. I'm going to lie down.

07:01.905 --> 07:02.865
Luke.

07:04.425 --> 07:05.665
You're back.

07:06.345 --> 07:07.785
Why are you home?

07:09.905 --> 07:11.065
Smells great.

07:11.145 --> 07:12.425
You started cooking once you got home?

07:14.305 --> 07:15.585
You've lost weight again.

07:15.665 --> 07:16.985
Did you skip your meals?

07:17.985 --> 07:18.865
I didn't.

07:18.945 --> 07:21.025
It's probably because
I've been busy with the experiments.

07:22.225 --> 07:24.185
I have been eating lots of meat.

07:24.265 --> 07:25.785
I brought back some Tan sheep.

07:26.625 --> 07:28.385
We'll grill lamb tonight.

07:28.465 --> 07:29.945
I'll take Luke to eat first.

07:30.745 --> 07:31.705
Go on, Luke.

07:31.785 --> 07:32.905
-Luke.
-See what you have for dinner.

07:34.585 --> 07:35.745
Come here.

07:44.625 --> 07:46.145
What's wrong?

07:46.225 --> 07:47.505
Stop looking at me.

07:49.705 --> 07:52.385
I'll make Yuanzhu some millet porridge.
It's good for his stomach.

07:54.425 --> 07:56.345
You're making him millet porridge?

07:57.265 --> 07:58.665
Putting a man before your friend, huh?

07:59.985 --> 08:01.025
Shut up.

08:05.785 --> 08:07.105
You deleted the account.

08:07.185 --> 08:08.385
Is Luan Nian still mad at you?

08:12.425 --> 08:14.105
I don't know. Whatever.

08:16.505 --> 08:20.065
The fact that he cared so much
means he really cares about you.

08:20.145 --> 08:20.985
It's on me.

08:22.305 --> 08:24.545
I didn't know
they were using your account.

08:24.625 --> 08:27.105
Otherwise, you two wouldn't have fought.

08:27.905 --> 08:29.425
I've told them to fix it.

08:30.305 --> 08:32.345
I don't want Luan Nian
to misunderstand you.

08:32.425 --> 08:33.585
I'd feel terrible about it.

08:34.264 --> 08:35.545
Besides, he helped me find investors.

08:35.625 --> 08:37.865
-You two--
-Don't overthink it.

08:38.945 --> 08:39.784
Okay?

08:39.865 --> 08:41.264
Don't worry.

08:41.345 --> 08:42.185
I can handle it.

08:44.825 --> 08:47.865
I'm starting to think workplace
relationships are just like romantic ones.

08:48.905 --> 08:51.705
If the other person doesn't trust you,
nothing you say will matter.

08:55.585 --> 08:59.025
Tao, do you see Luan Nian
as your boyfriend

08:59.905 --> 09:01.345
or your boss?

09:09.905 --> 09:11.225
I can't tell anymore.

09:14.185 --> 09:15.545
Maybe

09:16.545 --> 09:18.905
before I can see anyone as an equal,

09:20.345 --> 09:22.465
every relationship has someone above
and someone below.

09:25.785 --> 09:28.585
Tao dear, you sound a lot more mature now.

09:29.185 --> 09:32.185
Likewise. Now get back to cooking,

09:32.265 --> 09:33.545
Miss Sun.

09:34.625 --> 09:35.985
ONE MONTH LATER

09:36.065 --> 09:38.545
I'll meet up with the client first
in Shenzhen,

09:38.625 --> 09:39.905
then let's meet, okay?

09:41.305 --> 09:42.585
No problem.

09:42.665 --> 09:44.345
I've taken annual leave.

09:44.425 --> 09:46.545
When you get here, I'll show you around.

09:49.305 --> 09:50.025
YAO BEI

09:50.105 --> 09:51.545
You're coming to Shenzhen for work.

09:51.625 --> 09:53.385
Let's meet. Xin Zhaozhou.

09:54.825 --> 09:57.265
Bei, is Xin Zhaozhou in Shenzhen too?

09:57.345 --> 09:59.985
He just texted me.
He said he'd like to see me.

10:01.425 --> 10:03.785
I told him you were coming to Shenzhen
on business.

10:03.865 --> 10:06.625
I heard he received a government grant

10:06.705 --> 10:09.585
and started a trading company there.

10:09.665 --> 10:11.785
He's a big shot now.

10:14.185 --> 10:15.185
Would you like to see him?

10:15.985 --> 10:17.305
Why wouldn't I?

10:17.385 --> 10:18.465
It's not like we're enemies.

10:18.545 --> 10:20.185
We parted on good terms.

10:20.265 --> 10:24.425
After all, we shared the best years
of our lives together.

10:25.145 --> 10:27.385
Do you think he's still not over you

10:27.465 --> 10:28.625
and trying to get back together?

10:30.825 --> 10:31.705
No way.

10:31.785 --> 10:33.505
Even if he wanted to, I wouldn't.

10:33.585 --> 10:34.905
Don't overthink it.

10:36.545 --> 10:38.185
Alright. We'll talk later.

10:45.985 --> 10:49.345
SHENZHEN

10:55.945 --> 10:56.825
Luke,

10:56.905 --> 10:59.265
if we don't have dinner plans tonight,
I'll head out on my own.

10:59.345 --> 11:00.465
I'm meeting a friend.

11:01.225 --> 11:02.265
A friend?

11:03.465 --> 11:04.545
My college classmate.

11:05.585 --> 11:06.585
He's also my ex-boyfriend.

11:07.665 --> 11:08.905
Shang Zhitao.

11:33.945 --> 11:35.625
You're early.

11:42.385 --> 11:43.385
Is this your colleague?

11:45.385 --> 11:47.425
This is… This is my boss, Luke.

11:48.385 --> 11:51.745
This is my friend, Xin Zhaozhou.

11:51.825 --> 11:53.225
We're having dinner tonight.

12:00.265 --> 12:01.145
Have a good catch-up.

12:27.825 --> 12:28.745
Tao.

12:29.585 --> 12:30.425
You've changed a lot.

12:30.505 --> 12:32.025
You've become more mature.

12:33.345 --> 12:35.025
If I hadn't changed,

12:35.105 --> 12:37.785
these past few years
would've been for nothing.

12:40.345 --> 12:43.265
The man just now, that Luke, is your boss?

12:44.825 --> 12:46.305
He doesn't look easy to get along with.

12:48.185 --> 12:49.865
Just don't get on his bad side.

12:50.385 --> 12:53.065
Looks like you're doing
pretty well at work, Tao.

13:02.545 --> 13:03.745
Well…

13:05.705 --> 13:06.745
It's been tough.

13:09.185 --> 13:10.025
I know

13:10.665 --> 13:13.865
it wasn't easy for you to stick it out
in Beijing all these years.

13:13.945 --> 13:16.305
Back then, you wanted to go north,
and I wanted to come south.

13:17.225 --> 13:18.665
We all knew Beijing wasn't an easy place.

13:19.705 --> 13:20.785
But you were set on it.

13:20.865 --> 13:22.185
I couldn't stop you.

13:22.905 --> 13:24.585
All I could do was wish you the best

13:24.665 --> 13:26.865
and hope this cruel world
wouldn't swallow you whole.

13:28.025 --> 13:29.545
Sometimes I wonder

13:31.065 --> 13:34.065
if I hadn't come to Shenzhen
and had gone to Beijing with you instead,

13:34.785 --> 13:36.745
would I have made it this far too?

13:43.745 --> 13:45.385
Yao Bei told me

13:45.465 --> 13:47.785
you've made lots of new friends
in Beijing.

13:48.625 --> 13:51.585
Work's been going well,
you got promoted, got a raise,

13:51.665 --> 13:54.625
and even landed a major project
all on your own.

13:55.145 --> 13:56.305
I'm really proud of you.

14:01.185 --> 14:03.385
It was my fault.
I didn't hold on hard enough,

14:03.905 --> 14:05.825
so you had to carry all that on your own.

14:12.145 --> 14:13.145
Let's not talk about that.

14:14.905 --> 14:16.265
It's my first time in Shenzhen.

14:16.345 --> 14:17.985
The sea is beautiful.

14:21.305 --> 14:22.465
Do you like it here?

14:23.425 --> 14:25.545
I bought a two-bedroom apartment nearby.

14:26.065 --> 14:28.465
On weekends, I bring my parents over.

14:29.265 --> 14:31.985
They like going to the market
in the morning to buy fresh seafood.

14:32.065 --> 14:35.145
In the evening, we'll stroll along
the beach and watch the sunset.

14:36.545 --> 14:38.385
If you have time while you're here,

14:38.465 --> 14:39.785
I can show you around.

14:42.545 --> 14:43.625
Nice.

14:45.505 --> 14:47.465
Isn't this the life you've always wanted?

14:47.545 --> 14:50.105
Congrats. I'm really happy for you.

15:06.865 --> 15:07.705
Tao.

15:09.745 --> 15:11.265
I bought your favorite ice cream.

15:12.305 --> 15:13.745
Your favorite, red bean flavor.

15:18.905 --> 15:19.985
Thank you.

15:20.505 --> 15:21.945
Get some rest.

15:22.025 --> 15:23.865
I'll pick you up tomorrow evening.

15:23.945 --> 15:26.265
You can't miss the class reunion.

15:26.345 --> 15:27.225
Xin Zhaozhou,

15:28.225 --> 15:30.545
I have a business dinner tomorrow.

15:31.305 --> 15:33.345
I'm not sure when it ends.

15:34.025 --> 15:35.265
I probably can't make it.

15:37.305 --> 15:39.065
Is it because of me?

15:45.025 --> 15:46.745
Of course not. How could it be?

15:49.945 --> 15:51.545
You haven't changed at all, really.

15:52.185 --> 15:53.425
You're still just as bad at lying.

15:54.705 --> 15:57.425
Whenever you lie,
you can't look me in the eye.

16:01.825 --> 16:02.825
Who says I can't?

16:06.905 --> 16:07.905
Xin Zhaozhou,

16:09.505 --> 16:12.305
I'm really happy I got to see you today.

16:14.305 --> 16:16.545
I've wanted to tell you this
for a long time.

16:17.905 --> 16:20.225
I've never regretted being with you.

16:20.945 --> 16:22.385
I remember

16:22.465 --> 16:25.145
I used to blame you for not going
to Beijing with me.

16:25.225 --> 16:27.985
Looking back now, I honestly think

16:29.305 --> 16:31.305
I was so young and so immature.

16:32.385 --> 16:37.145
But seeing us both today
living the lives we wanted, I think

16:39.345 --> 16:40.545
it's a perfect ending.

16:40.625 --> 16:41.665
I'm happy for us.

16:47.105 --> 16:48.945
I know. I understand.

16:51.545 --> 16:53.225
The past is in the past.

16:56.145 --> 16:58.705
Can I… Can I have one more hug?

17:01.305 --> 17:02.465
Of course.

17:34.625 --> 17:36.465
I hope all my hard work pays off

17:36.545 --> 17:38.625
and that I can become your client soon

17:39.385 --> 17:40.825
and specifically ask for you.

17:46.185 --> 17:47.145
Sure.

17:47.225 --> 17:48.665
That day will come.

17:50.785 --> 17:51.945
I'm leaving.

18:30.225 --> 18:33.665
This is my friend, Xin Zhaozhou.

18:33.745 --> 18:35.145
We're having dinner tonight.

18:35.945 --> 18:36.865
He's also my ex-boyfriend.

19:41.665 --> 19:44.145
What is it, Flora?

19:45.265 --> 19:46.825
You said

19:46.905 --> 19:49.025
we should do one more rehearsal
before tomorrow's client meeting.

19:49.105 --> 19:50.785
I'm here to run through it with you.

19:52.705 --> 19:53.865
Did I?

19:54.665 --> 19:57.385
You said we always rehearse
before an S-tier client workshop.

20:01.185 --> 20:02.225
Come in.

20:21.425 --> 20:22.585
Aren't we rehearsing now?

20:22.665 --> 20:23.745
Go ahead.

20:24.345 --> 20:25.465
Alright.

20:25.545 --> 20:27.825
I'll start then.

20:28.545 --> 20:29.985
We'll begin with the first section.

20:31.065 --> 20:32.225
We…

20:38.425 --> 20:39.665
Can you hear me if I speak like this?

20:40.665 --> 20:42.425
I can. Go ahead.

20:45.745 --> 20:48.385
Then I'll start with the first section.

20:48.465 --> 20:50.025
Do you need the laptop?

20:51.225 --> 20:52.425
Do I?

20:56.185 --> 20:58.505
Well, I'll start from my side.

21:13.865 --> 21:14.705
LUAN SIYUAN

21:17.985 --> 21:19.025
Hello?

21:19.545 --> 21:20.865
I'm downstairs at your hotel.

21:22.225 --> 21:23.065
You're here?

21:24.025 --> 21:24.865
I'll be right down.

21:29.065 --> 21:30.545
Practice by yourself.

21:30.625 --> 21:31.665
I'm going out for dinner.

21:32.945 --> 21:33.905
Dinner?

21:35.305 --> 21:36.145
Is it important?

21:37.825 --> 21:39.185
My ex-girlfriend.

22:08.465 --> 22:10.425
If you don't perform well tomorrow,

22:10.505 --> 22:12.745
I'll transfer you to the Shenzhen branch

22:13.585 --> 22:16.225
so that you can rekindle feelings
with your ex-boyfriend.

22:20.345 --> 22:21.225
Luke.

22:22.505 --> 22:24.345
If you can't say anything nice,
don't say anything at all.

22:44.905 --> 22:45.745
Luan Nian.

22:47.705 --> 22:49.105
Where are we going, my little brother?

22:51.025 --> 22:52.105
Don't call me that.

22:52.185 --> 22:53.105
-Then what should I call you?
-Excuse me?

22:53.185 --> 22:54.385
My key card has been demagnetized.

22:54.465 --> 22:55.585
Sure. One moment, please.

22:55.665 --> 22:58.185
You're on my turf now.
Still want to pick a fight with me?

23:06.785 --> 23:07.945
Let's go.

23:24.265 --> 23:26.625
What's wrong? Trouble at work?

23:28.425 --> 23:29.425
No.

23:30.385 --> 23:34.145
Why do you look
like a rooster that just lost a fight?

23:37.385 --> 23:38.665
What got to you?

23:40.025 --> 23:40.905
Heartbroken?

23:46.025 --> 23:47.145
Siyuan.

23:48.425 --> 23:49.705
Do I really say awful things?

23:52.745 --> 23:55.705
Where's my arrogant little brother?

23:55.785 --> 23:57.785
What happened to my cocky little brother

23:57.865 --> 24:00.905
who could shut anyone up
with his sharp tongue?

24:00.985 --> 24:02.345
What's wrong with you, Luan Siyuan?

24:04.025 --> 24:05.825
You may have the sharpest mouth,

24:06.825 --> 24:09.865
but you've also got the softest heart.

24:12.185 --> 24:13.145
Come on.

24:13.225 --> 24:15.345
I'll treat you to something good.
Let's go.

24:22.945 --> 24:27.145
Today I'll be presenting
the marketing proposal for Jinyuan Tea.

24:27.705 --> 24:30.745
Our overall strategy
is to target younger consumers

24:30.825 --> 24:31.865
while expanding into lower-tier markets.

24:31.945 --> 24:34.585
Based on our market research and analysis,

24:34.665 --> 24:36.065
we've identified
our product's biggest strength.

24:36.745 --> 24:40.065
That is its rarity.

24:40.145 --> 24:42.265
It fills a gap in the tea market.

24:59.305 --> 25:01.345
JINYUAN'S BRAND APPROACH
DIFFERENTIATING CHANNELS, CUSTOMIZING

25:08.265 --> 25:11.945
The reason I ran this hiring experiment
was to prove one thing.

25:12.025 --> 25:13.905
People with natural talent
may shine quickly,

25:13.985 --> 25:15.785
but those who keep working hard

25:15.865 --> 25:17.305
are the ones who'll surprise you
in the long run.

25:17.385 --> 25:19.465
Flora was my first test case.

25:19.545 --> 25:21.105
I believe she'll go places.

25:21.865 --> 25:25.545
Maybe not today,
but maybe tomorrow or the day after.

25:26.065 --> 25:27.305
We just have to give her the chance.

25:31.665 --> 25:33.905
Alright. That's all for today.
Thank you, everyone.

25:41.625 --> 25:44.745
Mr. Luan, you've got quite a team.

25:46.465 --> 25:48.305
Luke, here's to you.

25:48.385 --> 25:49.705
Let's have one together.

25:49.785 --> 25:50.945
Cheers.

25:53.305 --> 25:55.625
It's been a real pleasure
working with you.

25:55.705 --> 25:57.145
I hope we can keep working together.

25:57.225 --> 25:58.265
Sure.

25:58.945 --> 26:00.105
Luke.

26:01.505 --> 26:02.465
Flora.

26:02.545 --> 26:04.185
Welcome to Shenzhen.

26:04.265 --> 26:07.905
I'm so happy to have entrusted
this project to Lime.

26:08.625 --> 26:10.345
Your proposal was on point.

26:10.425 --> 26:12.985
It solved most of our problems.
Thank you so much.

26:13.065 --> 26:14.985
Mr. Chen, let me toast you.

26:15.065 --> 26:16.745
We'll definitely make this a hit.

26:16.825 --> 26:18.345
I'll go over the remaining details
with you later.

26:19.505 --> 26:21.265
-Sure.
-Thanks for your support.

26:21.345 --> 26:22.705
Looking forward to working together again.

26:26.105 --> 26:27.065
Flora.

26:29.465 --> 26:30.665
-We'll talk later.
-Okay.

26:30.745 --> 26:31.865
Thanks.

26:34.665 --> 26:37.185
-Mr. Luan, a toast to you. Thank you.
-Flora, well done today.

26:41.385 --> 26:43.305
Flora, you were amazing today.

26:44.625 --> 26:46.425
-You did an incredible job.
-Thank you.

26:51.385 --> 26:53.545
Actually, I don't handle alcohol
very well.

27:07.865 --> 27:08.905
Flora.

27:36.705 --> 27:37.585
I'm fine.

27:38.545 --> 27:40.425
-I'm okay.
-Come. Lie down.

28:00.865 --> 28:02.785
XIN ZHAOZHOU

28:17.025 --> 28:18.065
Hi.

28:18.145 --> 28:20.785
We're having our class reunion tonight.
I can't get hold of Shang Zhitao.

28:20.865 --> 28:21.905
I'm a little worried,
so I came to check on her.

28:23.745 --> 28:25.425
She drank too much.
She's lying on the bed.

28:25.505 --> 28:26.745
She might throw up soon.

28:27.985 --> 28:29.105
Tao.

28:30.745 --> 28:31.905
Easy, Tao.

28:42.105 --> 28:43.185
Get it all out. Rinse your mouth.

28:49.105 --> 28:49.985
Now lie back down.

28:58.985 --> 29:00.225
I'll stay and take care of her tonight.

29:01.185 --> 29:02.025
Sounds good.

29:02.545 --> 29:04.905
Since you're here,
that saves me the trouble.

29:09.265 --> 29:10.785
Thanks for bringing her back.

29:10.865 --> 29:13.265
I'll look after her.
You should head back and get some rest.

29:14.985 --> 29:15.865
I can't do that.

29:16.745 --> 29:18.265
I'm responsible for the safety
of my company's female employees.

29:19.385 --> 29:22.825
Leaving a drunk woman alone with a man
is a bit risky.

29:24.505 --> 29:26.345
-We are actually…
-You're her ex, right?

29:26.425 --> 29:27.385
I know.

29:28.905 --> 29:30.825
Ex. Not current.

29:34.985 --> 29:35.905
Go ahead and take care of her.

29:36.625 --> 29:38.225
I'll be here. I won't get in your way.

29:40.385 --> 29:41.545
Luan Nian…

29:41.625 --> 29:43.065
Luan Nian…

29:43.145 --> 29:44.385
You…

29:44.465 --> 29:45.945
You jerk.

29:46.745 --> 29:48.585
You're a real piece of work.

29:49.865 --> 29:50.905
Who's Luan Nian?

29:53.265 --> 29:54.305
No idea.

29:55.385 --> 29:57.545
Maybe some guy she has a crush on.

29:58.985 --> 30:00.145
I want water.

30:01.105 --> 30:02.425
I want water.

30:13.745 --> 30:14.905
Drink slowly.

30:25.225 --> 30:26.265
You're not leaving?

30:26.345 --> 30:27.945
You're not gone either.

30:32.225 --> 30:33.625
Tao can't hold her liquor.

30:33.705 --> 30:34.585
And she threw up so much.

30:35.185 --> 30:36.825
Her throat's going to hurt later tonight.

30:37.425 --> 30:38.785
Whenever she's sick,
she kicks the blanket off.

30:40.265 --> 30:42.585
She's in safe hands with me. Don't worry.

30:42.665 --> 30:44.425
You're the one who worries me.

32:26.225 --> 32:27.265
Tao!

32:28.785 --> 32:29.825
Bei.

32:34.785 --> 32:36.425
The char siu

32:37.265 --> 32:40.225
and roast goose here are amazing.

32:40.305 --> 32:41.585
They're all my favorites.

32:41.665 --> 32:42.665
Let me try.

32:42.745 --> 32:44.425
The food here is really authentic.

32:45.545 --> 32:46.545
Is it good?

32:47.065 --> 32:47.945
Yes.

32:48.625 --> 32:49.665
Try this.

32:50.185 --> 32:51.265
Thanks.

32:52.025 --> 32:53.705
Let me have a good look at you.

32:55.665 --> 32:58.025
You're much more mature
than when you first went to Beijing.

32:58.105 --> 32:59.025
You're even prettier.

32:59.625 --> 33:01.145
You look great too.

33:03.705 --> 33:04.825
I got married.

33:07.665 --> 33:09.545
What? When did that happen?

33:09.625 --> 33:11.105
Why didn't you tell me?

33:11.185 --> 33:13.865
Two months ago.
It all happened so suddenly.

33:13.945 --> 33:16.545
We didn't have a wedding.
We just registered our marriage.

33:16.625 --> 33:17.865
So we didn't tell many people.

33:19.465 --> 33:21.665
That's wonderful.
What does your husband do?

33:22.465 --> 33:25.065
He's a local. He's an architect.

33:26.185 --> 33:29.825
Back then, he held out the blueprints
he designed and proposed to me

33:31.265 --> 33:33.385
and said I was the client of his life.

33:34.985 --> 33:37.025
For the first time,

33:37.665 --> 33:41.065
I felt the security
of having a family of my own.

33:42.745 --> 33:44.945
I felt incredibly lucky.

33:46.585 --> 33:47.625
Bei,

33:48.985 --> 33:51.785
being far from home,
you've found someone so wonderful.

33:51.865 --> 33:53.505
I'm really happy for you.

33:54.185 --> 33:55.345
Thank you.

34:00.185 --> 34:01.585
What about you?

34:01.665 --> 34:02.985
Do you have a boyfriend?

34:04.665 --> 34:05.665
Bei,

34:06.385 --> 34:07.825
you know me.

34:07.905 --> 34:12.025
Relationships have never been
a big part of my life.

34:15.905 --> 34:19.625
Have you thought about Xin Zhaozhou again?

34:20.425 --> 34:21.945
You two just met, didn't you?

34:22.665 --> 34:24.225
You know each other so well.

34:24.304 --> 34:26.304
He's doing really well now.

34:26.385 --> 34:28.545
He'd make a great husband.

34:29.625 --> 34:32.744
At the very least,
he always treated you like a princess,

34:32.824 --> 34:33.905
didn't he?

34:36.225 --> 34:37.744
Actually, I have a boyfriend.

34:38.545 --> 34:40.824
We've been together for four years.

34:43.145 --> 34:47.344
You know, to me,
you've always been such a wonderful girl.

34:47.425 --> 34:50.585
You've been with someone for four years,
yet I've never heard a word about him.

34:56.505 --> 34:58.585
Tao, listen to me.

34:59.585 --> 35:01.825
A good relationship helps you grow.

35:02.345 --> 35:03.865
Once you've dated for over three years,

35:04.465 --> 35:06.425
the chances of getting married
fall sharply.

35:07.785 --> 35:10.865
If you think he's the right man,

35:10.945 --> 35:12.945
you should start thinking
about the future.

35:13.465 --> 35:16.545
After all, a woman needs stability.

35:17.585 --> 35:18.825
Think about yourself too.

35:27.425 --> 35:28.785
Come on. Eat.

35:28.865 --> 35:30.265
Try this.

35:32.545 --> 35:34.145
-Have some more.
-Okay.

35:35.025 --> 35:36.065
Have one too, Bei.

35:42.705 --> 35:46.185
PRE-WEDDING TRAVEL PHOTOSHOOT

35:54.185 --> 35:56.425
Luan Nian, let's take a walk.

35:56.505 --> 35:57.865
I want to talk to you.

35:59.265 --> 36:00.225
Okay.

36:16.665 --> 36:17.505
Luan Nian,

36:18.905 --> 36:19.825
you know,

36:21.545 --> 36:23.505
I have a bucket list.

36:27.945 --> 36:31.265
There's one thing I wanted to do
before I turn 30.

36:33.345 --> 36:36.625
If I meet the right person,

36:38.185 --> 36:39.385
I want to get married.

36:40.905 --> 36:43.265
What if… I mean, what if

36:45.065 --> 36:46.825
we made our relationship public?

36:48.345 --> 36:49.825
We could be together openly.

36:49.905 --> 36:51.105
What do you think?

36:54.225 --> 36:56.185
You seem to like Luke too.

36:56.265 --> 36:57.385
We could raise him.

36:57.985 --> 37:01.865
We could go shopping, watch movies,

37:01.945 --> 37:03.825
meet each other's parents.

37:03.905 --> 37:05.505
We could get married.

37:05.585 --> 37:09.865
And maybe have a child.

37:10.465 --> 37:12.385
Just like a normal couple.

37:25.025 --> 37:26.185
I've never thought about any of that.

37:27.745 --> 37:29.385
I don't have a bucket list.

37:31.585 --> 37:32.585
Shang Zhitao,

37:34.785 --> 37:36.545
I know being with me hasn't been easy.

37:38.265 --> 37:40.345
People around me all say
I'm hard to get along with.

37:40.425 --> 37:41.745
That I've got a terrible temper.

37:43.145 --> 37:45.185
I know I'm not good at loving someone,

37:45.265 --> 37:46.865
but you're still young.

37:46.945 --> 37:48.265
You're not sure about a lot of things.

37:50.025 --> 37:52.185
You say you want to be with me,

37:52.265 --> 37:54.265
yet you still went to a matchmaking event.

37:56.425 --> 37:59.865
When I saw your ex-boyfriend
taking good care of you,

38:01.585 --> 38:05.065
and your roommate acting so close to you,

38:13.345 --> 38:15.465
I realized the kind of life you want

38:16.785 --> 38:18.105
might not be one I can give you.

38:20.705 --> 38:21.665
Luan Nian,

38:23.625 --> 38:25.585
I'm not someone
who falls in love casually.

38:27.425 --> 38:28.825
Before you,

38:30.185 --> 38:32.145
I'd only had one boyfriend.

38:33.785 --> 38:35.745
I never imagined we'd start like this,

38:35.825 --> 38:38.425
but that's how we did.

38:39.785 --> 38:42.825
Plus, you're my boss. My superior.

38:43.945 --> 38:45.945
I need this respectable job.

38:46.465 --> 38:48.225
So I'm exhausted.

38:49.225 --> 38:50.465
But that's on me.

38:52.745 --> 38:53.825
I hope you'll calm down.

38:59.745 --> 39:00.745
Fine.

39:02.825 --> 39:03.905
I get it.

39:04.745 --> 39:07.785
I thought our fourth year together

39:11.105 --> 39:13.625
would mean something deeper
than when we first dated.

39:29.185 --> 39:30.505
To be honest,

39:31.305 --> 39:34.425
what Luan Nian said that day
was sincere and gentle.

39:36.105 --> 39:37.345
But his words cut through our relationship

39:38.425 --> 39:40.545
like a knife,

39:42.745 --> 39:44.945
laying the truth bare. It hurt,

39:45.465 --> 39:47.545
but it also made me see things
more clearly.

39:52.305 --> 39:55.545
Some people are simply out of reach.

39:57.265 --> 40:00.545
Some obsessions have to end.

40:04.025 --> 40:06.345
As much as I longed for love,

40:07.345 --> 40:09.105
I was still struggling with reality.

40:11.345 --> 40:15.665
Between us stood an invisible wall
that neither of us could break through.

40:16.985 --> 40:19.305
It was built from our personalities,
families,

40:19.385 --> 40:21.225
and the way we grew up.

40:22.665 --> 40:24.545
We were never truly
on the same wavelength.

40:58.745 --> 40:59.705
Where were you?

41:01.225 --> 41:03.105
I… I went to see a friend.

41:03.665 --> 41:05.505
I came right back as soon as you called.

41:06.705 --> 41:07.665
Your ex-ex-boyfriend?

41:12.305 --> 41:13.585
I've only had one ex.

41:13.665 --> 41:15.545
Unlike someone
who has a long dating history.

41:16.545 --> 41:18.465
Hello. What's your name?

41:19.905 --> 41:22.305
Hello. You can call me Flora.

41:22.385 --> 41:23.625
I'm Luke's subordinate.

41:26.585 --> 41:27.425
Let's have dinner together.

41:28.105 --> 41:30.265
No thanks. You two go on a date.

41:31.345 --> 41:34.545
Do you think I'd date a man like him?

41:36.185 --> 41:38.625
If he weren't my brother,
I wouldn't even bother with him.

41:39.745 --> 41:41.825
He gets away with everything
just because he's good-looking.

41:41.905 --> 41:43.665
Bad temper. Sharp tongue.

41:44.385 --> 41:47.105
Luan Siyuan, watch your mouth.

41:50.945 --> 41:52.025
Nice to meet you, Miss Luan.

41:52.985 --> 41:56.465
Luke told his colleague
you were his ex-girlfriend.

41:57.065 --> 42:00.105
He even said you were so obedient,
you'd come running whenever he called.

42:03.305 --> 42:06.345
You're really making things up now.

42:08.865 --> 42:09.945
Forget it. I'm not eating with you.

42:10.025 --> 42:11.465
-You can leave now.
-You!

42:15.345 --> 42:16.665
Flora, I'm off.

42:28.465 --> 42:29.585
Do you have a minute?

42:30.345 --> 42:31.305
I

42:32.505 --> 42:33.345
need to talk to you.

42:37.185 --> 42:38.105
Sure.
